                      ( ../objs/shdw.asm):00005         * module and accesses data set up in that module.
                      ( ../objs/shdw.asm):00006         *
                      ( ../objs/shdw.asm):00007         * Much credit and thanks is give to Nick Sonneveld and the other NAGI
                      ( ../objs/shdw.asm):00008         * folks. Following his sources made it so much easier to document what
                      ( ../objs/shdw.asm):00009         * was happening in here.
