0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00099         V.Key2              RMB       1                   Key 2
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00100         V.Key3              RMB       1                   Key 3
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00101         V.ShftDn            RMB       1                   SHIFT/CTRL state
