002C                  (       cocovtio.d):00639         G.2Key3             RMB       1
                      (       cocovtio.d):00640         * Up to 3 keys can be registerd at once, and they are stored here. If more
                      (       cocovtio.d):00641         * than 3 are hit, the last key is overwritten with the very last key down that
                      (       cocovtio.d):00642         * was checked. Format for all three is the same as the PIA column/row byte @
                      (       cocovtio.d):00643         * KeyFlag below.
